-- DB update 2026_09_10_11 -> 2026_09_10_12
-- Arcane Mage rework (docs/arcane-mage-rework-design.md) - playtest bugfix pass, part 2
-- (2026-09-08, follow-up to rev_1788921755015417344.sql), see
-- .claude/skills/class-rework/SKILL.md.
--
-- 7268 ("Arcane Missile", the damage sub-spell every Arcane Missiles tick actually casts via
-- 5143's EffectTriggerSpell_2 - Arcane Missiles was consolidated to a single rank spanning
-- levels 8-80 in an earlier phase's "single-rank bootstrap"): every field needed for that
-- consolidation to work correctly (BaseLevel/SpellLevel/MaxLevel, RealPointsPerLevel,
-- EffectBonusMultiplier) was already carried over properly except SpellVisualID_1, which was
-- left at rank 1's own value (268) instead of the max real rank's (25345/25346 - "Rank 8",
-- SpellVisualID 270). Every player above the lowest levels was seeing the old, weaker rank-1
-- missile bolt model regardless of level - "arcane missiles has the rank 1 model instead of the
-- max rank model for its missiles". Fixed to 270.
--
-- Investigated but not changed: whether this is also the cause of the separately-reported
-- "pressing Arcane Missiles consumes the Missile Barrage buff and doesn't shoot the missiles,
-- also removes Arcane Blast stacks" - re-checked every ID in the chain (5143, 7268, 44404, 44401,
-- 36032, 200085) per the "changed to a single-rank system, might be pointing to a stale ID"
-- hypothesis; nothing else references an old/orphaned rank ID, in either the C++
-- (spell_mage.cpp only ever references 5143) or the DBC data. Worth a live retest now that the
-- visual is fixed before assuming a second, separate bug remains.
--
-- Produced by `python3 apps/dbc-tools/generate.py`, hand-extracted to just this one row - see
